<section class="py-32 px-12 max-w-[1920px] mx-auto">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-1">
<div class="bg-surface-container p-12 space-y-6 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-3xl">visibility_off</span>
<h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-on-surface">Anonymous Posting</h3>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">Identity is secondary to the image. Focus strictly on the perspective, not the persona.</p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-high p-12 space-y-6 border-y-4 border-primary shadow-2xl z-10">
