<p class="text-on-surface-variant font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">Navigate the editorial feed via a spatial interface. See the world from every angle.</p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container p-12 space-y-6 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-3xl">hub</span>
<h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-on-surface">SnapZone Integration</h3>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">Seamlessly transition from local captures to global community curation pipelines.</p>
</div>
</div>
